# The police of the game: the tuning of the indoor police by reputation (InPolice.SetGVars of
# missions/inpolice.py) and the attack waves outdoors (OutPolice.InitWaves of missions/outpolice.py). The format is
# described in src/game/Script/Script.c. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/missions/police.def replaces this file.
#
# The C picks the section by the save variable BadReputation: in0, in1 or in2 (2 and above) for the indoor police,
# waves0 to waves5 for the waves (other values have none). "run wave <ship> ..." appends one wave, a list of ships,
# to OutPolice.PoliceWaves; "run defscale <var> <factor>" sets the engine variable to its default times the factor.


section in0
call Scrap.Set AlarmFallDelta -0.200
call Scrap.Set AlarmGrowDelta 0.020
# sentinel
call Scrap.Set SentinelAcuseSpeed 0.4
call Scrap.Set SentinelAcuseTime 3.5
call Scrap.Set SentinelSuspectSpeed 0.3
call Scrap.Set SentinelSuspectTime 3.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelInspectSpeed 0.25
call Scrap.Set SentinelInspectTime 2.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelBankerDetect 10
# gear
call Scrap.Set GearChaseSpeed 1
call Scrap.Set GearAttackSpeed 0.305
call Scrap.Set GearLostTargetTime 6.0
call Scrap.Set GearRobberyDetection 15
run defscale AngleStrafeUnderAttackGearAI 0.0
call Scrap.Set ShootGearAI 5
# bishop
run defscale AngleStrafeUnderAttackBishopAI 0.0
call Scrap.Set ShootBishopAI 5
# messenger
call Scrap.Set ShootMessengerAI 3
call Scrap.Set VelRotDinamicMessengerAI 3
call Scrap.Set MessengerGotoSpeed 0.25

section in1
call Scrap.Set AlarmFallDelta -0.15
call Scrap.Set AlarmGrowDelta 0.045
# sentinel
call Scrap.Set SentinelAcuseSpeed 0.4
call Scrap.Set SentinelAcuseTime 3.5
call Scrap.Set SentinelSuspectSpeed 0.3
call Scrap.Set SentinelSuspectTime 3.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelInspectSpeed 0.25
call Scrap.Set SentinelInspectTime 2.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelBankerDetect 10
# gear
call Scrap.Set GearChaseSpeed 1
call Scrap.Set GearAttackSpeed 0.305
call Scrap.Set GearLostTargetTime 6.0
call Scrap.Set GearRobberyDetection 15
run defscale AngleStrafeUnderAttackGearAI 0.0
call Scrap.Set ShootGearAI 5
# bishop
run defscale AngleStrafeUnderAttackBishopAI 0.0
call Scrap.Set ShootBishopAI 5
# messenger
call Scrap.Set ShootMessengerAI 3
call Scrap.Set VelRotDinamicMessengerAI 3
call Scrap.Set MessengerGotoSpeed 0.25

section in2
call Scrap.Set AlarmFallDelta -0.15
call Scrap.Set AlarmGrowDelta 0.045
# sentinel
call Scrap.Set SentinelAcuseSpeed 0.6
call Scrap.Set SentinelAcuseTime 3.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelSuspectSpeed 0.5
call Scrap.Set SentinelSuspectTime 3.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelInspectSpeed 0.25
call Scrap.Set SentinelInspectTime 3.0
call Scrap.Set SentinelBankerDetect 30
# gear
call Scrap.Set GearChaseSpeed 0.75
call Scrap.Set GearAttackSpeed 0.25
call Scrap.Set GearLostTargetTime 5.0
call Scrap.Set GearRobberyDetection 30
run defscale AngleStrafeUnderAttackGearAI 1.0
call Scrap.Set ShootGearAI 3
# bishop
run defscale AngleStrafeUnderAttackBishopAI 1.0
call Scrap.Set ShootBishopAI 3
# messenger
call Scrap.Set ShootMessengerAI 2
call Scrap.Set VelRotDinamicMessengerAI 4
call Scrap.Set MessengerGotoSpeed 0.35

section waves0
call Scrap.Set AlarmFallDelta -0.15
call Scrap.Set AlarmFallMission 1.0
run wave SPoli1_Rookie SPoli1_Rookie
run wave SPoli2_Rookie
run wave SPoli1_Rookie SPoli1_Rookie
run wave SPoli2_Rookie SPoli2_Rookie
run wave SPoli1_Pilot
run wave SPoli1_Pilot SPoli1_Rookie SPoli2_Rookie
run wave SPoli2_Pilot SPoli1_Rookie SPoli1_Rookie
